  "structure": {
    "block_count": 102,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "The Breast Milk Jewelry Guide for Breastfeeding Moms",
        "text_sha256": "8eb225d3b52813bd499af25902c236dc3a0e53ba7087bc79a0914e0225ed29c7",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Best Breast Milk Jewelry 2021",
        "text_sha256": "0b3f5d2a7ca4fd9038007cdab585a7dacfaa04a083cefde7c7b0e6ca402085de",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you chose to breastfeed, you may have experienced some hurdles on your journey: cracked or sore nipples, a too-strong letdown, a fussy newborn with latch issues or other common nursing issues . But you likely also experienced some of the most tender moments you can have with a baby, like that happy, milk-drunk look and snuggling after a good feed.",
        "text_sha256": "fbe554230ea90a83935fd332ba2cc8185a714ac00dc63d8706619c2ccecf5846",
        "word_count": 61
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Because breastfeeding brings up strong emotions and can seem like such a hard-earned win — whether you’ve been doing it for a week or year — many women choose to turn their liquid gold into a permanent keepsake in the form of breast milk jewelry.",
        "text_sha256": "4fb2081b65d165b1e813ec0d5868f37a8efbd232f2f7a8d6fc1359d3fc6711d4",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Breast milk jewelry has been a trend since at least 2013 , coinciding with a growing movement to celebrate breastfeeding. It has since taken off with dozens of different custom jewelry makers offering moms the chance to preserve their breast milk for posterity. “Moms often want something preserved to honor and memorialize motherhood,” says Brittani Beals, owner of Made With Love Keepsakes , an online jewelry business based in Grand Junction, Colorado specializing in handmade breast milk jewelry.",
        "text_sha256": "6de7da574064da7ce700aa7ebc170374cdd69db8a1551e4e371959e0652b0d65",
        "word_count": 78
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Types of breast milk jewelry",
        "text_sha256": "e4d56ab4a68417866c5767815fc261320a3dcbd207eb8b6008e2e9171f25791b",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As with other forms of jewelry, there’s a wide range of breast milk jewelry you can have created. Those include:",
        "text_sha256": "a09f92d204961da3067b472939e1b585f0321c2be9af3db2707733a748abe057",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Rings. A breast milk ring is exactly what it sounds like: a ring where the \"stone\" is actually made of preserved breast milk. These rings come in many different shapes and sizes, and you might opt to add colored glitter or metallic flakes for a unique look. Some companies also incorporate other substances into the jewelry, such as powdered placenta or crushed umbilical cord.",
        "text_sha256": "ff41f33c0cf51c0ba2a0c131d00a2f2fb2535d756929e502327ad97de5a0e5e6",
        "word_count": 64
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Necklaces. Your liquid gold can be turned into a pendant that you can wear on a chain as a necklace.",
        "text_sha256": "f2fd98b21f35c2012d3d76f0b444b967b7313e628d21ead1653fb1197e09dc48",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Earrings. Prefer to wear your breast milk on your ears? A jeweler can turn your breast milk into studs or something similar for you to sport.",
        "text_sha256": "fd5733602b1ccadc4d6e9461590e19cbe2c22312ee879b1b538f593b76b20595",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bracelets. Just as with wearing your breast milk on a necklace, it can be incorporated into a pendant and then worn on your wrist.",
        "text_sha256": "506c902833532f4fc5e8af801b31d21746aa280a529b9c086a069e8f9aaaf3bc",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How is breast milk jewelry made?",
        "text_sha256": "0c2ac7d374be83745223daadd38be9b9d48b4996cd9a316cdc057ac9f7a01bac",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "After you choose the design and color you'd like for your breast milk jewelry, the designer will tell you how much milk they need in order to create the piece. This is actually the easy part (the tough part is deciding from one of the many gorgeous designs).",
        "text_sha256": "1399aa3dbbe62892e1ee7718cf72c6f5120984351c7aceb90e07f3a5127678a0",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Mamas are nervous that it’s a big process to send out milk, but it’s not,” says Beals. Since the breast milk won’t be consumed, it doesn’t need to be refrigerated or frozen when shipped. Plus, while the amount needed can vary among companies, many need just 1 teaspoon to 1/2 an ounce of milk, depending on the item you're ordering. That’s good news, because it makes breast milk jewelry all the more accessible for moms who aren’t overproducers.",
        "text_sha256": "2d4489b09121ea34dce680e5d06263a4683203f3ece0f6f21260b5166a635d72",
        "word_count": 78
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Next, the jewelry designer will get to work on preserving your milk. It’s usually boiled to sterilize it, and then a special preservative is added to zap moisture and turn the milk into a hard material that won’t rot or grow bacteria, Beals says. After that, she pulverizes the \"rock\" into a fine powder, adds a resin and drops in requested colors or shimmers. Beals also includes a pearl shimmer to enhance the appearance of the breast milk, which can sometimes appear dull on its own.",
        "text_sha256": "fdf8109b3a4e9ecbbcbf898cfcb5f8034e6373bc1b71dab746b9f5299b09e748",
        "word_count": 86
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The length of the process differs by jeweler and the type of piece you're ordering. Companies may need eight weeks or longer, so make sure you clarify with the jeweler how long the process will take before you order.",
        "text_sha256": "ab6d33c4e3b23efc0f9d511649c0394df1d746bc6adaaabb5c5d1e0df89cc039",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Where to find breast milk jewelry",
        "text_sha256": "253e4ded8681508b35037ccb5d11ecb1c46b38c695b9ce40bf636f60d56097eb",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The best place to shop for breast milk jewelry is at a reputable store or online retailer that specializes in these custom pieces. Beals suggests looking for a jeweler that will be upfront about their process and let you know how they keep samples separate to eliminate the risk of a mix-up. Reviews can also be helpful, particularly on Etsy.",
        "text_sha256": "3c0c432fe8e5c8487a5110d98fa0b7c2fa65e3036cbbab21596a1e59d4771bfe",
        "word_count": 60
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Final word of advice: Follow the care instructions for your new piece exactly as advised. A breast milk ring is different than one made of precious stones, and you want your new jewelry to stay with you for a lifetime.",
        "text_sha256": "bca4110cbbf039b0b6838e64b0088d75cd65b40b6cb307f95f116e20c599291f",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How we made our picks for the best breast milk jewelry",
        "text_sha256": "c4360d75ab59a7ca1a5dc2d5aaf51daf33a7a41d5b479db8f1991458820c66df",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "We found the best breast milk jewelry by looking at the most popular options on the market, including What to Expect readers’ favorites. Those were narrowed down to the ones with the best ratings and product reviews. Then, we looked for items with unique features that really stand out. Here, we’ve rounded up the best breast milk jewelry to help you remember this special time forever.",
        "text_sha256": "0dd491afa92fceabc1a6975514790c705261746df938630e7e5d31c2efd897e3",
        "word_count": 66
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best Breast Milk Necklace",
        "text_sha256": "8aaf741de1edbb1676cf658dcb71bf5979f9f298e437071b753c7ef677ca55a0",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Lait Sous La Lune Large Milkdrop Necklace",
        "text_sha256": "07cfcc9107ec3f084a55112c85c7fe118d3b54c441e8b03734867f4771d53f24",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Simple",
        "text_sha256": "3fee95da5ab69ebfdc16ec892b754105a11c20203054a6c6bcc0a60176891043",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "eye-catching",
        "text_sha256": "f1224fc90e6b77cbcb51dbcca0bbbc9205932c1f16fcd30c4d9005f171f0f7c5",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "customizable",
        "text_sha256": "b0401117e807e81570c51ba54b18330b5e4fe353c293d58d4e0d647ca41042da",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Resin may discolor over time",
        "text_sha256": "af710ab0acc7f57879c1dab01dac595d16a303dcdf0910e676db230bb48e597e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why We Love It",
        "text_sha256": "6e31e7604a2268d00ddf2594453e493aef84f8dd297f3a72433e60834fa4117b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This teardrop-shaped necklace is a total statement piece. It features your milk with your choice of add-ons, including foil, flakes, glitter and shimmer. (You can also include baby hair, dried placenta or ashes, depending on what you’re commemorating.) Moms appreciate how well the seller communicates during the process, and how receptive they are to answering questions about your piece. Pieces also come with a limited one-year warranty in case it wears prematurely.",
        "text_sha256": "34778da508bce5a40f6af7e0c8467003e2f9e4d368bc9ea387670d5f09d7ec88",
        "word_count": 72
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Materials used: Gold or silver",
        "text_sha256": "dfeafa90a58888eb8f91cf9fe1150bc29f3e2534b3504f39d120e93b17f712a6",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Milk required: 10 milliliters",
        "text_sha256": "f50fb16ffe8b7bcc31d10180747dfe5e5fa0b4a2486ebad48c89cbeff20f9e81",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dimensions: 18 x 25 millimeter pendant on 18 inch chain",
        "text_sha256": "2b39a9987793399fa690231fb67caa1f8f9d56a000811dbf9132f2ddda74235a",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "heading",
