        "text": "This set of dainty stacking rings can be uniquely customized. Choose your child's birth stone and stack it with a breast milk-only ring, or mix your breast milk into the stone. If you have more than one child, you can purchase additional rings for an additional $17 each. You can add additional shimmer or “fine pink sparkle,” along with things like formula, placenta, ashes, or other items. However, it may take a bit to get your finished pieces — up to 16 weeks after your breast milk is received — but happy moms say the products are worth the wait.",
