        "text": "FYI: Etsy prohibits its vendors from selling products made with bodily fluids or human remains, so any breast milk jewelry you see on the site will be the DIY variety. Marky Baby makes some of the best kits, and this beautiful ring is no exception. With an oval breast milk stone in the center surrounded by starburst-style sparkly stones, this ring is a true statement piece. Choose from a silver or rose gold band and setting for a look that fits in with your style. All kits come with preservation kits and detailed instructions. Moms say it was easier than expected to follow the directions for preserving breast milk and making the jewelry, and note that the customer service was excellent.",
